flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Create or load Dataset]
    B --> C{Rows valid and finite?}
    C -- No --> X[Report input error]
    C -- Yes --> D[Split data using fixed seed]
    D --> E[Fit scaler on training data]
    E --> F[Transform training and test features]
    F --> G[Compare lambda candidates using training cost]
    G --> H[Fit coordinate-descent model]
    H --> I[Predict test targets]
    I --> J[Calculate evaluation metrics]
    J --> K[Report metrics and selected features]
    K --> L([End])
    X --> L
